# Deliberately empty. spec/.shellcheckrc disables SC2317 and SC2329 for the
# shellspec DSL only, where ShellCheck cannot see how `Describe`/`It`/`Mock`
# blocks and `When call` actually execute. gh-mock-dispatch.sh under this
# directory is a real, standalone shell script, not shellspec syntax, so
# both checks belong active against it — the same reasoning spec/.shellcheckrc
# already applies to the plugin scripts. ShellCheck resolves the nearest
# .shellcheckrc to the file being checked without merging into ancestors, so
# this empty file is what restores the defaults here (verified: an empty
# spec/support/.shellcheckrc makes SC2317/SC2329 fire again on a script that
# would otherwise inherit the parent's disable).
